        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of progressive cerebellar ataxia plus genetic confirmation of TMEM240 mutation",
    "notes": "Genetic testing is essential for definitive diagnosis due to phenotypic overlap with other SCAs."
